    - rid: 4751322063800107175
      type: {class: DialogueNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeGuid>k__BackingField: 8ad6f870-5d15-49bf-bdbf-d55651c0cd38
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2796, y: 10.5}
        <DialogueNodePorts>k__BackingField:
        - PortGuid: a8e6cab1-4290-4b9d-b299-6803153a1795
          InputGuid: f6f983fa-8ff3-4268-9bb7-4241362feb73
          OutputGuid: 8ad6f870-5d15-49bf-bdbf-d55651c0cd38
          Text: "W porz\u0105dku. Daj pieni\u0105dze."
        - PortGuid: 53828887-fb66-4071-896a-fead973fbc3d
          InputGuid: f61e7ae8-acae-4eea-8503-1af6cce4811d
          OutputGuid: 8ad6f870-5d15-49bf-bdbf-d55651c0cd38
          Text: "Nie mam czasu na pierdo\u0142y."
        <AudioClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Szefie, nie chodzi o \u017Cadne pieni\u0105dze! Wr\u0119cz
          przeciwnie, bo akurat mamy dwa z\u0142ote. Chcemy Ci\u0119 poprosi\u0107
          o drobn\u0105 przys\u0142ug\u0119. Id\u017A do Gra\u017Cyny i kup \u201E\u015Awi\u0119tego
          Graala\u201D, to takie wino. Stara rura nie chce go sprzeda\u0107, bo to
          edycja limitowana. Pewnie trzyma dla kogo\u015B innego."
        <npcSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 01295fa5bd053974990a134185033d40, type: 3}
        <playerSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f2d2a7d738e8e75488c4fea351131b93, type: 3}
        <Name>k__BackingField: Zdzichu Jones
    - rid: 4751322063800107176
      type: {class: DialogueNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeGuid>k__BackingField: 61e247de-49c4-40de-a49a-82a9b18c5890
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 3990, y: 73}
        <DialogueNodePorts>k__BackingField:
