          Text: Dalej
        <AudioClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Kurwa, sk\u0142adali\u015Bmy si\u0119 czy nie? Wi\u0119c
          te\u017C mam prawo wybra\u0107. A ja nic poza \u201E\u015Awi\u0119tym Graalem\u201D
          pi\u0142 nie b\u0119d\u0119!\n"
        <npcSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 40e44573e52ea0f41941cb9e1d87bb24, type: 3}
        <playerSprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Name>k__BackingField: Endrju
    - rid: 4751322063800107189
      type: {class: CheckpointSplitterNodeData, ns: jbzdy.DialogueSystem.NodeDatas, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
